{
  "title": "ssvep_board",
  "summary": "Top level: the partners' analog front end (ANALOG, their sheet with the planned minimal edits) plus our three sheets. POWER makes +3.3V for everything analog and hands the switched cell to the XIAO. MCU talks SPI to the ADS131M08 on the ANALOG sheet and enables the analog LDO. PD brings the screen-sync photodiode into ADC channel 4.",
